  "description": {
   "en": "When spring came, when the colorful wildflowers budded in the wide meadows, Irene had to struggle with anguish.\n\n\"Hmph...\"\n\nA tickling sensation from a secret place. When she went into heat, she couldn't do anything for a week. Worse yet, she couldn't find a male to share her estrus with.\n\nMeanwhile, Knox caught a whiff of a sweet scent on the breeze blowing in from somewhere. The scent of a female in heat.\n\nHe pulled back Irene's robe, and her snow-white hair spilled out. The corners of his tightly pressed lips lifted.\n\n\"A female anthromorph... Come with me.\""
  },
